# owed-derivations-mutants reads: the reader and the writer it mutates (the writer copied with its whole
# reconcile directory, because it lifts functions out of apply.sh and preclassify.sh), the sibling driver
# owed-derivations/run.sh (re-executed against each copy; declared whole), the shared preamble that driver
# sources, and the real validator both programs run. scripts/install.sh is the marker run.sh walks up for.
